  <title>Přidávání a vytváření adresářů</title>

  <p>You can have multiple address books. For example, you might have one
  address book for work related contacts and one for private contacts. The sidebar
  lists those address books, and you can select which address book is
  shown.</p>

  <p>Můžete také používat adresáře, které nejsou přímo ve vašem počítači, ale na Internetu (např. Google) nebo v místní síti (např. LDAP).</p>
  <p>New contacts are created in the selected address book in the Contacts window. If no address book is selected, new contacts are created in the default address book.</p>

  <section>
    <title>Collection accounts</title>
    <p>Different types of mail, address books, calendars, task and memo lists, belonging to the same user, can be added in one step, by utilizing a <link xref="intro-account-types#collection-account">Collection account</link>.</p>
  </section>
